* From J. C. Shaw, "JOSS: Examples of the Use of an Experimental On-Line Computing Service", RAND P-3131, April 1965, page 3.
*  Stored program for computing the hypotenuse:

1.1 Set c=sqrt(a*2+b*2).
1.2 Type a,b,c in form 1.
Form 1:
a = __   b = __   c = ___.______
2.1 Do part 1 for b=1(1)a.
2.2 Line.
Type all steps.

1.1 Set c=sqrt(a*2+b*2).
1.2 Type a,b,c in form 1.

2.1 Do part 1 for b=1(1)a.
2.2 Line.

Type form 1.
a = __   b = __   c = ___.______

Do part 2 for a=1(1)4.
